# Trade Me

> Trade Me is an online auction and classifieds website. It is one of the biggest websites in New Zealand. Sam Morgan founded Trade Me in 1999. Fairfax bought Trade Me in 2006. ApaxPartners bought Trade Me in 2019. Trade Me has offices in Auckland, Christchurch, and Wellington.

Important notes: Trade Me has many listing categories. Customers can list or buy in Property, Motors, Marketplace, Jobs, and Services. The website also has news and articles. Ping is the built-in payment system.

## online business verticals

- [Trade Me Property](https://www.trademe.co.nz/a/property): Trade Me Property helps you find a home in New Zealand. You can browse real estate listings. This lets you find properties for sale or rent.
